<title>UK: Allders gain as H1 profits double.</title>
<headline>Allders gain as H1 profits double.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in British retailer Allders Plc rose 11p to 251 after the company reported a doubling of first-half pre-tax profits, dealers said.</p>
<p>Pre-tax profit rose 16.0 million stg from 8.0 million, boosted by buoyant trading.</p>
<p>Allders said its second half had started well, adding to the shares strength, dealers said.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
